  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>&nbsp;此資源包仍在開發中，待相關功能（即附加模組支援）推出後，將進一步加入更多暗黑風格（Blackout）貼圖。</p>\n<p><strong>目前支援的附加模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2WLIB</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended AE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded AE</a><br><br>\n<p><strong>免責聲明</strong></p>\n<p>這些貼圖大多並非由我製作，內容取自《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 (AE2)</a>》。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如有需要，歡迎在 Discord 聯繫我：void_odyssey</p>\n<p><strong>功能特色</strong></p>\n<p>將許多過於昏暗或存在視覺異常的貼圖改為亮色模式。<br>此外，新風格的亮色模式貼圖也已反向移植至 1.20.1（可選）。</p>\n<p>方塊變更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gcjvVRs.png\" alt=\"*方塊變更*\" width=\"970\" height=\"771\"></p>\n<p>物品變更</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tsRQwTh.png\" alt=\"*物品變更*\" width=\"1296\" height=\"729\"></p>",
